  "description": "Lee Chang-hyun is your typical playboy; a bad boy with an even worse personality, there’s nothing he likes more than flirting with the girls on campus. And thanks to his uncanny ability to hide his true nature, he's able to land just about any object of his desire. But lately, he's been particularly captivated by the mysterious - and undeniably attractive - Choi Juhee. Approaching her with his usual routine of playing boy-next-door, Chang-hyun tries his luck with the seemingly innocent Juhee…however Chang-hyun is about to find out that things are not always what they seem, and even the most beautiful of flowers can have the sharpest thorns.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/NONE_LOVE/), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/none_love), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000064183), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11409024), [Comico](https://www.comico.kr/comic/10931)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://www.lezhinus.com/en/comic/lovetohateyou)",
